{"version":1,"key":"quest:108","content":{"id":108,"title":"img 标签 sizes 属性的作用是什么？用于什么场景？","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:108","type":"quest","id":108},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"sizes 属性需配合 srcset 用于响应式图片","meta":"","excerpt":"img 的 sizes 属性是用来完成响应式图片的核心技术，需要配合 srcset 使用。 在下载图片的时候，浏览器可能还不知道需要下载多大的图片，这个时候就可以通过 sizes 属性来对浏览器进行提示，浏览器结合视口大小和 dpr，以及 sizes 中定义的查询条件找到图片会被渲染为什么大小，然后根据大小去 srcs","target":{"key":"card:658","type":"card","id":658},"citeKey":"card:658"}],"trail":[{"time":1763188718305,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1767355213375,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1767355213381,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"createTime":1763188718305,"updateTime":1763188718305,"resolvedTime":1767355213381},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1763188718305}}